      "content": "The pressure to \"keep going\" often comes not to stop you from feeling pain, but to help everyone feel less alone in the struggle. It is completely normal in this void to want to give up the \"lie\" that we matter, even when that \"lie\" feels like the only thing keeping you from despair. I encourage you to talk to a suicide crisis counselor who can help you find the peace you need to get through the pain \"to the end\" you describe.\nPlease be safe and reach out to a crisis line",
      "source": "target",
